-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M118 -250V750H255V710H158V-210H255V-250H118Z\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-5B\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M84 237T84 250T98 270H679Q694 262 694 250T679 230H98Q84 237 84 250Z\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-2212\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M462 0Q444 3 333 3Q217 3 199 0H190V46H221Q241 46 248 46T265 48T279 53T286 61Q287 63 287 115V165H28V211L179 442Q332 674 334 675Q336 677 355 677H373L379 671V211H471V165H379V114Q379 73 379 66T385 54Q393 47 442 46H471V0H462ZM293 211V545L74 212L183 211H293Z\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-34\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M78 35T78 60T94 103T137 121Q165 121 187 96T210 8Q210 -27 201 -60T180 -117T154 -158T130 -185T117 -194Q113 -194 104 -185T95 -172Q95 -168 106 -156T131 -126T157 -76T173 -3V9L172 8Q170 7 167 6T161 3T152 1T140 0Q113 0 96 17Z\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-2C\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M22 710V750H159V-250H22V-210H119V710H22Z\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-5D\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M78 60Q78 84 95 102T138 120Q162 120 180 104T199 61Q199 36 182 18T139 0T96 17T78 60Z\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-2E\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMATHI-49\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"782\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-3D\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<g transform=\"translate(1838,0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-5B\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"278\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-2212\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1057\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-34\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"1557\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-2C\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2002\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-34\" y=\"0\"></use>\n<use x=\"2503\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-5D\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n<use x=\"4786\" xlink:href=\"#E11-MJMAIN-2E\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> </p>\n<p>Now, before we analyze our sets, we need to state a couple of theorems:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p> <strong> <em>Theorem 1</em> </strong>: <em>Every real interval of nonzero length contains infinitely many rational numbers.</em></p>\n<p> <strong> <em>Theorem 2</em> </strong>: <em>If <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.176ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 852.5 936.9\" width=\"1.98ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-12-Title\">X</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M42 0H40Q26 0 26 11Q26 15 29 27Q33 41 36 43T55 46Q141 49 190 98Q200 108 306 224T411 342Q302 620 297 625Q288 636 234 637H206Q200 643 200 645T202 664Q206 677 212 683H226Q260 681 347 681Q380 681 408 681T453 682T473 682Q490 682 490 671Q490 670 488 658Q484 643 481 640T465 637Q434 634 411 620L488 426L541 485Q646 598 646 610Q646 628 622 635Q617 635 609 637Q594 637 594 648Q594 650 596 664Q600 677 606 683H618Q619 683 643 683T697 681T738 680Q828 680 837 683H845Q852 676 852 672Q850 647 840 637H824Q790 636 763 628T722 611T698 593L687 584Q687 585 592 480L505 384Q505 383 536 304T601 142T638 56Q648 47 699 46Q734 46 734 37Q734 35 732 23Q728 7 725 4T711 1Q708 1 678 1T589 2Q528 2 496 2T461 1Q444 1 444 10Q444 11 446 25Q448 35 450 39T455 44T464 46T480 47T506 54Q523 62 523 64Q522 64 476 181L429 299Q241 95 236 84Q232 76 232 72Q232 53 261 47Q262 47 267 47T273 46Q276 46 277 46T280 45T283 42T284 35Q284 26 282 19Q279 6 276 4T261 1Q258 1 243 1T201 2T142 2Q64 2 42 0Z\" id=\"E12-MJMATHI-58\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\">\n<use x=\"0\" xlink:href=\"#E12-MJMATHI-58\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> is infinite and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-13-Title\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"2.509ex\" role=\"img\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.671ex;\" viewbox=\"0 -791.3 3228.6 1080.4\" width=\"7.499ex\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-13-Title\">X\\subseteq Y,</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path d=\"M42 0H40Q26 0 26 11Q26 15 29 27Q33 41 36 43T55 46Q141 49 190 98Q200 108 306 224T411 342Q302 620 297 625Q288 636 234 637H206Q200 643 200 645T202 664Q206 677 212 683H226Q260 681 347 681Q380 681 408 681T453 682T473 682Q490 682 490 671Q490 670 488 658Q484 643 481 640T465 637Q434 634 411 620L488 426L541 485Q646 598 646 610Q646 628 622 635Q617 635 609 637Q594 637 594 648Q594 650 596 664Q600 677 606 683H618Q619 683 643 683T697 681T738 680Q828 680 837 683H845Q852 676 852 672Q850 647 840 637H824Q790 636 763 628T722 611T698 593L687 584Q687 585 592 480L505 384Q505 383 536 304T601 142T638 56Q648 47 699 46Q734 46 734 37Q734 35 732 23Q728 7 725 4T711 1Q708 1 678 1T589 2Q528 2 496 2T461 1Q444 1 444 10Q444 11 446 25Q448 35 450 39T455 44T464 46T480 47T506 54Q523 62 523 64Q522 64 476 181L429 299Q241 95 236 84Q232 76 232 72Q232 53 261 47Q262 47 267 47T273 46Q276 46 277 46T280 45T283 42T284 35Q284 26 282 19Q279 6 276 4T261 1Q258 1 243 1T201 2T142 2Q64 2 42 0Z\" id=\"E13-MJMATHI-58\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M84 346Q84 468 166 546T360 635Q361 635 370 635T395 635T430 636T475 636T524 636H679Q694 628 694 616Q694 607 681 597L522 596H470H441Q366 596 338 592T266 568Q244 557 224 542T179 500T139 433T124 346V341Q124 253 185 185Q244 121 328 103Q348 98 366 98T522 96H681Q694 86 694 76Q694 64 679 56H526Q510 56 480 56T434 55Q350 55 289 71T172 141Q84 223 84 346ZM104 -131T104 -118T118 -98H679Q694 -106 694 -118T679 -138H118Q104 -131 104 -118Z\" id=\"E13-MJMAIN-2286\" stroke-width=\"1\"></path>\n<path d=\"M66 637Q54 637 49 637T39 638T32 641T30 647T33 664T42 682Q44 683 56 683Q104 680 165 680Q288 680 306 683H316Q322 677 322 674T320 656Q316 643 310 637H298Q242 637 242 624Q242 619 292 477T343 333L346 336Q350 340 358 349T379 373T411 410T454 461Q546 568 561 587T577 618Q577 634 545 637Q528 637 528 647Q528 649 530 661Q533 676 535 679T549 683Q551 683 578 682T